//"You can't do 2-week iterations with hardware!" This is the first thing you'll hear when talk turns to Agile methods in hardware-software product development.//
//A mix of existing robust hardware development ideas, plus a few newly taken from Agile software are being used now by real teams, even to get around - or through - the challenge of doing fast iterations (Nancy Van Schooenderwoert)//

